🚢 Titanic Survival Prediction


Overview

This project implements a complete machine learning pipeline to predict Titanic survival. It automatically handles:

Data preprocessing & feature engineering

Hyperparameter tuning for Random Forest & XGBoost

Model training for Random Forest, XGBoost, Logistic Regression, and Neural Network

Validation evaluation with accuracy, ROC, Precision-Recall, confusion matrix, and learning curves

Automatic best model selection based on validation AUC

Test set predictions and submission file creation

The notebook is fully automated and ready for Kaggle submission.

Dataset

Kaggle Titanic Dataset: Link

train.csv: Training data with labels

test.csv: Test data without labels

Features Used

Feature	Description
Pclass	Passenger class (1, 2, 3)
Sex	Gender
Age	Age in years
SibSp	Number of siblings/spouses aboard
Parch	Number of parents/children aboard
Fare	Ticket fare
Embarked	Port of embarkation (C = Cherbourg, Q = Queenstown, S = Southampton)
Pipeline
1. Data Preprocessing

Missing values handled:

Age: median

Fare: median (test set)

Embarked: mode

Encode categorical features (Sex, Embarked) with LabelEncoder

2. Feature Selection

Selected features for all models:

['Pclass', 'Sex', 'Age', 'SibSp', 'Parch', 'Fare', 'Embarked']

3. Train/Validation Split

80% training, 20% validation

4. Hyperparameter Tuning

Random Forest:

n_estimators: [50, 100, 200]

max_depth: [None, 5, 10]

min_samples_split: [2, 5]

min_samples_leaf: [1, 2]

XGBoost:

n_estimators: [50, 100, 200]

max_depth: [3, 5, 7]

learning_rate: [0.01, 0.1, 0.2]

subsample: [0.8, 1.0]

5. Models

Random Forest (tuned)

XGBoost (tuned)

Logistic Regression (baseline)

Neural Network (MLPClassifier, 2 hidden layers (50,50))

Evaluation Metrics

Accuracy: Overall correctness

Confusion Matrix: True/False positives & negatives

Classification Report: Precision, Recall, F1-score

ROC Curve & AUC: Discriminative ability

Precision-Recall Curve & AP: Performance on imbalanced data

Learning Curve: Training vs validation accuracy

