Best Model Selection

Automatically selects the model with the highest validation AUC

Used to predict the test dataset

Submission

Generates submission.csv file ready for Kaggle submission:

PassengerId,Survived
892,0
893,1
...


Download directly from Colab using:

from google.colab import files
files.download("submission.csv")

Libraries Used
pandas
numpy
matplotlib
seaborn
scikit-learn
xgboost
google.colab


Make sure to upgrade XGBoost to avoid compatibility issues:
pip install --upgrade xgboost

Usage Instructions

Upload train.csv and test.csv to Colab

Run all cells sequentially

Notebook will:

Preprocess data

Tune hyperparameters for RF & XGBoost

Train all models

Evaluate and visualize results

Select best model automatically

Generate test predictions and submission.csv

Download submission.csv and submit to Kaggle

